# Ulamog, the Defiler's ruling: "If Ulamog is entering the battlefield directly from exile, it will see itself when
# determining which card has the greatest mana value among cards in exile." Cast on turn 1, Ulamog enters with two
# +1/+1 counters (a Counterspell is the costliest card its cast trigger exiled). Bot1 then Ephemerates it: Ulamog is
# exiled and returned as a new object (CR 400.7), and as it enters it is still in exile, so the greatest mana value there is
# its own 10. It enters with ten counters, a 17/17.

